    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ae7a1b81f6744222",
      "translationZh": "The Bloke 提供的包含兼容 GPTQ 模型的仓库。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "05dde6db3d7298aa",
      "translationZh": "GPTQ 论文的通俗概述",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0f8e6736e0c32d90",
      "translationZh": "量化方法通常属于以下两类之一：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "74f6efa1fc8947ef",
      "translationZh": "训练后量化（PTQ）：我们使用适量资源对预训练模型进行量化，例如一个校准数据集和几小时的计算。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7fd06b93f623229a",
      "translationZh": "量化感知训练（QAT）：在训练或进一步微调之前进行量化。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a7652f2868892756",
      "translationZh": "GPTQ 属于 PTQ 类别，这对于超大规模模型尤其有吸引力，因为对这类模型进行完整训练甚至微调，成本都可能非常高。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "415008c22ea8faaa",
      "translationZh": "具体而言，GPTQ 采用 int4/fp16 混合量化方案，其中权重被量化为 int4，而激活值仍保持为 float16。在推理期间，权重会被即时反量化，实际计算则以 float16 进行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e99ce9c6aef81cf",
      "translationZh": "这一方案有两方面的好处：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "001c77350ff947e1",
      "translationZh": "int4 量化可带来接近 x4 的内存节省，因为反量化是在靠近计算单元的融合内核中进行的，而不是在 GPU 全局内存中进行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "950ec97c9e965375",
      "translationZh": "权重使用更低的位宽，减少了数据通信所需的时间，因此有望带来加速。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "25a58f783ae8b094",
      "translationZh": "GPTQ 论文着手解决逐层压缩问题：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ec8854b72ba2980e",
      "translationZh": "给定一个层 lll，其权重矩阵为 WlW_{l}Wl​，层输入为 XlX_{l}Xl​，我们希望找到权重的量化版本 W^l\\hat{W}_{l}W^l​，使均方误差（MSE）最小：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "34faee52baea9c1d",
      "translationZh": "一旦逐层求解了这个问题，就可以通过组合各层的解来获得全局问题的解。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "da50bf261578d7d8",
      "translationZh": "为了解决这一逐层压缩问题，作者采用了 Optimal Brain Quantization 框架（Frantar 等，2022）。OBQ 方法的出发点是这样一个观察：上述方程可以写成 WlW_{l}Wl​ 各行的平方误差之和。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "48eeecf880ae4a7a",
      "translationZh": "这意味着我们可以独立地量化每一行。这称为逐通道量化。对于每一行 Wl[i,:]W_{l[i,:]}Wl[i,:]​，OBQ 每次量化一个权重，同时始终更新所有尚未量化的权重，以补偿量化单个权重所引入的误差。对所选权重的更新具有一个利用 Hessian 矩阵的闭式公式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6dadd21cd151e77d",
      "translationZh": "GPTQ 论文通过引入一系列优化来改进这一框架，在保留模型准确性的同时降低了量化算法的复杂度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e79a06ab30e53f84",
      "translationZh": "与 OBQ 相比，GPTQ 的量化步骤本身也更快：使用 OBQ 量化一个 BERT 模型（336M）需要 2 GPU 小时，而使用 GPTQ，量化一个 Bloom 模型（176B）所需的时间不到 4 GPU 小时。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cee2f0fcc51e1658",
      "translationZh": "如需进一步了解具体算法，以及困惑度和加速效果方面的各项基准测试，请参阅原始论文。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "58d0be3cee2caaba",
      "translationZh": "AutoGPTQ 库——为 LLM 高效利用 GPTQ 的一站式库",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fcfb93cceaa8094a",
      "translationZh": "AutoGPTQ 库支持用户使用 GPTQ 方法量化 🤗 Transformers 模型。GPTQ-for-LLaMa、Exllama 和 llama.cpp 等同期社区项目仅针对 Llama 架构实现量化方法，而 AutoGPTQ 则凭借对多种 transformer 架构的顺畅支持而广受欢迎。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "664e20cd47fd922a",
      "translationZh": "由于 AutoGPTQ 库覆盖了更多 transformer 模型，我们决定提供集成的 🤗 Transformers API，让所有人都能更轻松地量化 LLM。目前，我们已集成最常用的优化选项，例如 CUDA 内核。如需使用 Triton 内核或融合注意力兼容性等更高级的选项，请参阅 AutoGPTQ 库。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4a7b13ce6de11f34",
      "translationZh": "🤗 Transformers 原生支持 GPTQ 模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5b69779503c42a64",
      "translationZh": "安装 AutoGPTQ 库和 optimum（pip install optimum）后，在 Transformers 中运行 GPTQ 模型现在就这么简单：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "48f62c11a30a41a4",
      "translationZh": "请查阅 Transformers 文档，进一步了解所有功能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0778c8ed208b113c",
      "translationZh": "我们的 AutoGPTQ 集成具有许多优势：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f85b1acc9073528f",
      "translationZh": "量化模型可以序列化，并可在 Hub 上共享。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d54920d1a3e2f73e",
      "translationZh": "GPTQ 大幅降低了运行 LLMs 所需的内存，而推理延迟与 FP16 推理相当。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bf0c4fb6ca58a6a3",
      "translationZh": "AutoGPTQ 支持适用于多种架构的 Exllama 内核。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d663947f7908528c",
      "translationZh": "此次集成为 AMD GPUs 提供了原生 RoCm 支持。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f904ebb2ab0d7b6b",
      "translationZh": "支持使用 PEFT 进行微调。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ec97716c532e106c",
      "translationZh": "你可以在 Hub 上查看你喜欢的模型是否已经过量化。TheBloke 是 Hugging Face 的顶尖贡献者之一，他使用 AutoGPTQ 量化了大量模型，并将它们分享到 Hugging Face Hub 上。我们通力合作，确保这些仓库能够通过我们的集成开箱即用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5f511cc2fcfd544e",
      "translationZh": "这是 batch size = 1 情况下的一个基准测试示例。该基准测试在单张 NVIDIA A100-SXM4-80GB GPU 上运行。我们使用了长度为 512 的提示词，并恰好生成了 512 个新 token。第一行是未经量化的 fp16 基线，其余行则展示了使用不同 AutoGPTQ 内核时的内存消耗和性能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e5e59d10f196504b",
      "translationZh": "比特",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6923dd1bc0460082",
      "translationZh": "内核",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
